[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Golden Eagle are creatures found in [[Terrain|Mountain]]. They can fly over cliffs, and normally fly around on 3d speed. If you kill them, you can pick them up like [[rabbit]]s. [[Dead Golden Eagle]] takes 3x2 slots in the inventory.

Not to be confused with [[Eagle Owl]]s, which are weaker and less rewarding to hunt.

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Somewhat Aggressive, always flying around highspeed.

